{"segment_id": "segment_00008", "start": 240.0, "end": 270.0, "speech": "句修饰前面的 the man，这就是我们在讲语法的时候重点强调的那个点。各位希望各位还记得，就是你修饰谁，一定要紧跟着谁，不要放离他很远的地方，对吧？OK，你要把它放在 hat 的后面，别人会以为你是想说我服务的帽子吗？就翻译不通了，对不对？就是我服务的那名男士当时正戴着一个帽子啊，就像我一样，是吧？Very good.那所以 the man who I served was wearing a hat.", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000018.webp", "time": 240.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["MANAGER: Which books did you buy?", "CUSTOMERAThe books whic are on", "the counter.", "MANAGER: Did you serve this gentleman", "half an hour ago, Caroline?", "He sayshe's the man", "whobought these books.", "CUSTOMER: I can't remember.", "The man who I served was wearing a hat."], "scores": [0.9962, 0.95544, 0.99112, 0.98819, 0.97603, 0.99073, 0.96563, 0.97201, 0.96113], "boxes": [[[57.0, 270.0], [948.0, 281.0], [947.0, 347.0], [56.0, 335.0]], [[56.0, 336.0], [918.0, 336.0], [918.0, 404.0], [56.0, 404.0]], [[59.0, 404.0], [345.0, 408.0], [344.0, 461.0], [58.0, 456.0]], [[55.0, 736.0], [1013.0, 734.0], [1013.0, 802.0], [55.0, 804.0]], [[55.0, 794.0], [685.0, 798.0], [685.0, 864.0], [55.0, 859.0]], [[56.0, 861.0], [551.0, 861.0], [551.0, 926.0], [56.0, 926.0]], [[546.0, 856.0], [1134.0, 856.0], [1134.0, 924.0], [546.0, 924.0]], [[60.0, 922.0], [767.0, 926.0], [767.0, 978.0], [60.0, 974.0]], [[55.0, 979.0], [1000.0, 982.0], [1000.0, 1046.0], [55.0, 1043.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
