{"segment_id": "segment_00014", "start": 420.0, "end": 450.0, "speech": "How did she recognize him as the man who whom she had served? Okay, 我再读一遍啊. How did she recognize him as the man whom she had served? 好，我简单翻译一下这句话。这句话对于各位来说稍微有一点点难。他是如何认出这名男士的？Whom she had served叫做他服务的这名男士。那整句连起来就是他是如何", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000035.webp", "time": 420.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Comprehension", "7 T: How did she recognize him as the man", "whom she had served?"], "scores": [0.99943, 0.98058, 0.97944], "boxes": [[[93.0, 138.0], [462.0, 136.0], [462.0, 195.0], [93.0, 198.0]], [[143.0, 280.0], [1160.0, 284.0], [1160.0, 347.0], [143.0, 342.0]], [[144.0, 343.0], [682.0, 343.0], [682.0, 402.0], [144.0, 402.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000036.webp", "time": 441.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Comprehension", "7 T: How did she recognize him as the man", "whom she had served?"], "scores": [0.9993, 0.97341, 0.98106], "boxes": [[[94.0, 138.0], [462.0, 138.0], [462.0, 198.0], [94.0, 198.0]], [[144.0, 280.0], [1159.0, 285.0], [1159.0, 344.0], [144.0, 338.0]], [[144.0, 346.0], [681.0, 343.0], [681.0, 400.0], [144.0, 402.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000037.webp", "time": 444.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Comprehension", "7 T: How did she recognize him as the man", "whom she had served?"], "scores": [0.99926, 0.96901, 0.96282], "boxes": [[[94.0, 138.0], [462.0, 138.0], [462.0, 198.0], [94.0, 198.0]], [[143.0, 279.0], [1160.0, 284.0], [1160.0, 344.0], [143.0, 338.0]], [[143.0, 343.0], [682.0, 343.0], [682.0, 402.0], [143.0, 402.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000038.webp", "time": 448.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Comprehension", "7 T: How did she recognize him as the man", "whom she had served?"], "scores": [0.99933, 0.98158, 0.98022], "boxes": [[[94.0, 138.0], [462.0, 138.0], [462.0, 198.0], [94.0, 198.0]], [[143.0, 280.0], [1160.0, 284.0], [1160.0, 347.0], [143.0, 342.0]], [[144.0, 343.0], [682.0, 343.0], [682.0, 402.0], [144.0, 402.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
{"segment_id": "segment_00015", "start": 450.0, "end": 480.0, "speech": "认出这名他服务过的男士的啊？She recognized him when she put on put his hat on. 哎，当他把他帽子戴出来的时候，他就认识了。好吧，next one, asking questions. 我给肯定句，您变一般疑问句，变特殊疑问句啊。第一题，Ask me if the man bought two dictionaries, 对吧？这就是基本功了。看见 bought, 提 do does did, am is are", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000039.webp", "time": 463.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions"], "scores": [0.98244], "boxes": [[[89.0, 133.0], [496.0, 138.0], [495.0, 205.0], [88.0, 199.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
{"segment_id": "segment_00016", "start": 480.0, "end": 510.0, "speech": "was, were, can, must, may.这么多单词都可以提前。您要提谁，对吧？包括have, has, had啊，这么多单词都可以提。提did一般过去时，对吧？Did the man buy two dictionaries? Next one. What?那What did the man buy? Next one. Ask me if he forgot to take them with him. Did he forget to take them with him? Why?", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000040.webp", "time": 487.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "1 T: Ask me if the man bought two dictionaries.", "S: Did the man buy two dictionaries?"], "scores": [0.99188, 0.97526, 0.98025], "boxes": [[[90.0, 135.0], [493.0, 138.0], [493.0, 202.0], [90.0, 198.0]], [[144.0, 280.0], [1253.0, 286.0], [1253.0, 347.0], [144.0, 340.0]], [[142.0, 344.0], [1014.0, 346.0], [1014.0, 412.0], [142.0, 410.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000041.webp", "time": 498.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "2 T: Ask me if he forgot to take them with him."], "scores": [0.99298, 0.97987], "boxes": [[[90.0, 134.0], [494.0, 138.0], [494.0, 202.0], [90.0, 197.0]], [[142.0, 281.0], [1227.0, 281.0], [1227.0, 346.0], [142.0, 346.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
{"segment_id": "segment_00017", "start": 510.0, "end": 540.0, "speech": "why did he forget to take them with him? Very good. Next one. Ask me if Caroline served him. Did Caroline serve him? Who, who served him? 好，who其实可以对Caroline和him提问，对吧？但如果你对主语提问，不要忘了不用变一般疑问句，对吧？如果对宾语提问，也就是him去提问的时候，一定要变一般疑问句。", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000042.webp", "time": 510.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "2 T: Ask me if he forgot to take them with him.", "S: Did he forget to take them with him?", "T:Why...?", "S: Why did he forget to take them with him?"], "scores": [0.98164, 0.96464, 0.96755, 0.8108, 0.99358], "boxes": [[[91.0, 135.0], [493.0, 138.0], [493.0, 201.0], [91.0, 197.0]], [[142.0, 279.0], [1226.0, 282.0], [1226.0, 348.0], [142.0, 345.0]], [[142.0, 343.0], [1068.0, 345.0], [1068.0, 411.0], [142.0, 409.0]], [[142.0, 408.0], [413.0, 413.0], [412.0, 478.0], [141.0, 472.0]], [[144.0, 473.0], [1176.0, 473.0], [1176.0, 539.0], [144.0, 539.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000043.webp", "time": 515.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions"], "scores": [0.99789], "boxes": [[[91.0, 134.0], [496.0, 139.0], [495.0, 203.0], [90.0, 197.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000044.webp", "time": 528.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "3 T: Ask me if Caroline served him.", "S: Did Caroline serve him?", "T: Who...?", "S: Who served him?"], "scores": [0.99272, 0.97823, 0.96932, 0.90605, 0.96156], "boxes": [[[90.0, 135.0], [493.0, 139.0], [493.0, 203.0], [90.0, 198.0]], [[146.0, 284.0], [966.0, 284.0], [966.0, 339.0], [146.0, 339.0]], [[144.0, 346.0], [779.0, 348.0], [779.0, 405.0], [144.0, 403.0]], [[142.0, 410.0], [420.0, 412.0], [420.0, 469.0], [142.0, 466.0]], [[145.0, 474.0], [631.0, 477.0], [631.0, 533.0], [145.0, 531.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
